# the picture: PLAY grows a new one through a fade; the night grows another. (no keeping one:
# REC has no use in a scene, and its light is dark)
# (ZEN-1 boots into the scene)
wait 800
wait 2000
expect mode 1
expect regrows 0
expect kept 0
expect seed16 >-1
tap PLAY
wait 250
expect fade <200
wait 1200
expect regrows 1
expect fade 256
expect seed16 3345
shot regrown.png
# REC: nothing kept, nothing saved, the light dark
tap REC
wait 2000
expect kept 0
# (REC glows dim in testing builds, as the tests run: it shows the load readout; dark in a release)
expect ledREC 1
expect regrows 1
# after a reboot: nothing kept
reboot
wait 1500
expect mode 1
expect kept 0
